"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Sullivan County shows January to February under 90% of normal in 33 of 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 66% and April to May at 75% on the middle of the grids. Grid 19691 had its driest year in 2007 at 63% of normal. A preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 on grid 19692 sits at 96.0, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
